## Interface: 16001
## Title: Verity by Ryna
## Notes: What a group says of the people it played with: tag a member of a dungeon run (commend or report, from a fixed list, no free text), see your own notes on a player's tooltip, and send your tags to Ryna's pool. A mod of Ryna; /ryna verity.
